{"id":"85c36bdc2628e3c0","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-categorical-completeness.md","title":"简单类型 CCC 可靠性与完备性","display":"thm-categorical-completeness — 简单类型 CCC 可靠性与完备性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"2","label":"16-thm-categorical-completeness","aliases":["16-thm-categorical-completeness","16-thm--categorical-completeness"],"display":"thm-categorical-completeness — 简单类型 CCC 可靠性与完备性","depends_on":["[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]","[[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]"],"source":"Proposition 2.3.2, pp. 139–140 (PDF 159–160); Definition 2.4.1 and Theorem 2.4.2, pp. 147–148 (PDF 167–168); soundness/completeness is a local generic-model consequence","review_status":"local-proof-completed","review_date":"2026-10-16","verification_status":"proof-reviewed-not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_date":"2026-10-16","resolved_review_note_id":"J03","current_review_boundary":"有限积简单类型演算的βη及良型等式规格；集合编码CCC中的任意基类型与常量解释。未证明正规化、判定性或依赖类型论的完备性。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-categorical-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-categorical-completeness</span><span>16-thm--categorical-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-categorical-completeness — 简单类型 CCC 可靠性与完备性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" href=\"?note=923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" title=\"16-df-simple-type-semantics\">16-df-simple-type-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"899007f1346b21cf\" href=\"?note=899007f1346b21cf\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntactic-category\">16-df-stlc-syntactic-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 2.3.2, pp. 139–140 (PDF 159–160); Definition 2.4.1 and Theorem 2.4.2, pp. 147–148 (PDF 167–168); soundness/completeness is a local generic-model consequence"},{"key":"review_status","html":"local-proof-completed"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proof-reviewed-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"resolved_review_note_id","html":"J03"},{"key":"current_review_boundary","html":"有限积简单类型演算的βη及良型等式规格；集合编码CCC中的任意基类型与常量解释。未证明正规化、判定性或依赖类型论的完备性。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})\">\\(\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"899007f1346b21cf\" href=\"?note=899007f1346b21cf\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntactic-category\">16-df-stlc-syntactic-category</a> 采用的有限积简单类型签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma u:\\tau\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma u:\\tau\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\Gamma\">\\(P_\\Gamma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^\\flat_\\Gamma\">\\(t^\\flat_\\Gamma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf S_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{\\mathrm g}\">\\(\\rho_{\\mathrm g}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_{\\mathrm g}\">\\(\\kappa_{\\mathrm g}\\)</span> 及其选定 CCC 结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_{\\mathrm g}\">\\(\\Theta_{\\mathrm g}\\)</span> 采用该页构造。</li>\n<li>模型记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(\\mathcal C,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)\">\\(M=(\\mathcal C,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_M,I_M,E^M\">\\(T_M,I_M,E^M\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" href=\"?note=923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" title=\"16-df-simple-type-semantics\">16-df-simple-type-semantics</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 始终是当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的底层CCC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_{\\mathrm g}\">\\(M_{\\mathrm g}\\)</span> 是下文定义的泛模型；模型量词是对集合编码记录的普通量词。</li>\n<li>在代换式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(\\gamma_1,\\ldots,\\gamma_n)\">\\(\\Gamma=(\\gamma_1,\\ldots,\\gamma_n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma s_i:\\gamma_i\">\\(\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma s_i:\\gamma_i\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i^M_\\sigma=\\langle!_{T_M(\\sigma)},1_{T_M(\\sigma)}\\rangle:T_M(\\sigma)\\to I_M((\\sigma))\">\\(i^M_\\sigma=\\langle!_{T_M(\\sigma)},1_{T_M(\\sigma)}\\rangle:T_M(\\sigma)\\to I_M((\\sigma))\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq(\\mathsf S_\\Sigma,\\Theta_{\\mathrm g},\\rho_{\\mathrm g},\\kappa_{\\mathrm g}),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M_{\\mathrm g}),\\qquad\nT_{M_{\\mathrm g}}(\\sigma)=\\sigma,\\quad I_{M_{\\mathrm g}}(\\Gamma)=P_\\Gamma,\\quad\nE^{M_{\\mathrm g}}_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)=[t^\\flat_\\Gamma]:P_\\Gamma\\to\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq(\\mathsf S_\\Sigma,\\Theta_{\\mathrm g},\\rho_{\\mathrm g},\\kappa_{\\mathrm g}),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M_{\\mathrm g}),\\qquad\nT_{M_{\\mathrm g}}(\\sigma)=\\sigma,\\quad I_{M_{\\mathrm g}}(\\Gamma)=P_\\Gamma,\\quad\nE^{M_{\\mathrm g}}_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)=[t^\\flat_\\Gamma]:P_\\Gamma\\to\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E^M_{\\Delta,\\tau}(t[\\mathbf s])=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)\\circ A^M_\\Gamma(E^M_{\\Delta,\\gamma_1}(s_1),\\ldots,E^M_{\\Delta,\\gamma_n}(s_n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E^M_{\\Delta,\\tau}(t[\\mathbf s])=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)\\circ A^M_\\Gamma(E^M_{\\Delta,\\gamma_1}(s_1),\\ldots,E^M_{\\Delta,\\gamma_n}(s_n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"i^M_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\langle!_{T_M(\\sigma)},1_{T_M(\\sigma)}\\rangle,\\qquad\nF_M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq T_M(\\sigma),\\qquad\nF_M([v]:\\sigma\\to\\upsilon)\\coloneqq E^M_{(\\sigma),\\upsilon}(v)\\circ i^M_\\sigma,\\qquad\nF_M:\\mathsf S_\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[i^M_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\langle!_{T_M(\\sigma)},1_{T_M(\\sigma)}\\rangle,\\qquad\nF_M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq T_M(\\sigma),\\qquad\nF_M([v]:\\sigma\\to\\upsilon)\\coloneqq E^M_{(\\sigma),\\upsilon}(v)\\circ i^M_\\sigma,\\qquad\nF_M:\\mathsf S_\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:\\tau\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow E^{M_{\\mathrm g}}_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)=E^{M_{\\mathrm g}}_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(u)\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\ \\bigl(\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longrightarrow E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(u)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:\\tau\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow E^{M_{\\mathrm g}}_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)=E^{M_{\\mathrm g}}_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(u)\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\ \\bigl(\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longrightarrow E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(u)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 pp.139–140（PDF159–160）证明句法分类范畴为 CCC，pp.147–148（PDF167–168）定义 CCC 函子模型并给签名赋值/模型的对应。本页可靠性与完备性是以下明确补写的泛模型论证；不冒称原书此处有同名编号完备性定理。良型等式规格的处理沿用本地语法扩展。</li>\n<li>代换引理按项树归纳。λ 情形的提升代换解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_\\Gamma(E(\\mathbf s))\\times1\">\\(A_\\Gamma(E(\\mathbf s))\\times1\\)</span>，指数转置的自然性使先替换后抽象等于先抽象后复合；其余构造由投影、配对和评价的复合律直接得到。因此此结论不依赖先有可靠性。</li>\n<li>可靠性对有限等式推导树归纳。反身、对称、传递和构造子相容由箭头相等保持。公理叶由模型谓词。代换规则由代换引理。积 β/η 与单元 η 分别来自积的投影/唯一配对和终对象唯一性；箭头 β 来自评价转置方程，箭头 η 来自转置唯一性。故每个可导等式在每个指定模型中成立。</li>\n<li>泛模型计算对项树归纳：变量是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[q_i]\">\\([q_i]\\)</span>，常量公式由代换结合律和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i[a(\\mathbf t)]\\equiv t_i\">\\(q_i[a(\\mathbf t)]\\equiv t_i\\)</span> 得到；积与应用直接对应句法箭头。λ 情形先在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\Gamma\\times\\sigma\">\\(P_\\Gamma\\times\\sigma\\)</span> 上用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i[\\pi_1x_1]\">\\(q_i[\\pi_1x_1]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_2x_1\">\\(\\pi_2x_1\\)</span> 解释 λ 体，再作句法转置；提升代换和积 β 把所得项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\lambda_\\sigma v)^\\flat\">\\((\\lambda_\\sigma v)^\\flat\\)</span>。各公理在语法中可导，代换到投影后两商类相等，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_{\\mathrm g}\">\\(M_{\\mathrm g}\\)</span> 确实满足所有公理。</li>\n<li>完备性取这个具体模型：语义相等给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[t^\\flat]=[u^\\flat]\">\\([t^\\flat]=[u^\\flat]\\)</span>，按商定义即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P_\\Gamma)\\vdash t^\\flat\\equiv u^\\flat:\\tau\">\\((P_\\Gamma)\\vdash t^\\flat\\equiv u^\\flat:\\tau\\)</span>；代换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_\\Gamma\">\\(e_\\Gamma\\)</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^\\flat[e_\\Gamma]\\equiv t\">\\(t^\\flat[e_\\Gamma]\\equiv t\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^\\flat[e_\\Gamma]\\equiv u\">\\(u^\\flat[e_\\Gamma]\\equiv u\\)</span>，得到原等式。空语境也成立，关键是单元 η。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_M\">\\(F_M\\)</span> 对商类良定义由可靠性；代换引理给复合保持，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_2\\circ i^M_\\sigma=1\">\\(p_2\\circ i^M_\\sigma=1\\)</span> 给恒等保持。构造公式使它保持指定终对象、积和指数，且实现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\kappa\">\\(\\rho,\\kappa\\)</span>；单变量解释的源含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\times T_M(\\sigma)\">\\(1\\times T_M(\\sigma)\\)</span>，所以公式显式前接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i^M_\\sigma\">\\(i^M_\\sigma\\)</span>。这给出与书中函子模型接口相容的具体解释，不把裸项解释名称当作证明。</li>\n<li>本页 J03 已由独立 STLC 语法/商 CCC/递归语义消解；旧强一阶 DTT 项模型没有作为依赖。没有机器证明或任意大范畴模型的集合编码断言。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-simple-type-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"923cb52a5ddfc2cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntactic-category","status":"resolved","id":"899007f1346b21cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntactic-category","status":"resolved","id":"899007f1346b21cf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})$ 是 [[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]] 采用的有限积简单类型签名，$\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau$、$\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma u:\\tau$。$P_\\Gamma$、$t^\\flat_\\Gamma$、$\\mathsf S_\\Sigma$、$\\rho_{\\mathrm g}$、$\\kappa_{\\mathrm g}$ 及其选定 CCC 结构 $\\Theta_{\\mathrm g}$ 采用该页构造。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-type-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"923cb52a5ddfc2cd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"模型记录 $M=(\\mathcal C,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)$、$\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma$、$T_M,I_M,E^M$ 采用 [[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]，$\\mathcal C$ 始终是当前 $M$ 的底层CCC。$M_{\\mathrm g}$ 是下文定义的泛模型；模型量词是对集合编码记录的普通量词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma u:\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"t^\\flat_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_{\\mathrm g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_{\\mathrm g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta_{\\mathrm g}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(\\mathcal C,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"T_M,I_M,E^M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M_{\\mathrm g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=(\\gamma_1,\\ldots,\\gamma_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma s_i:\\gamma_i","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M)","display":false},{"tex":"i^M_\\sigma=\\langle!_{T_M(\\sigma)},1_{T_M(\\sigma)}\\rangle:T_M(\\sigma)\\to I_M((\\sigma))","display":false},{"tex":"M_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq(\\mathsf S_\\Sigma,\\Theta_{\\mathrm g},\\rho_{\\mathrm g},\\kappa_{\\mathrm g}),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M_{\\mathrm g}),\\qquad\nT_{M_{\\mathrm g}}(\\sigma)=\\sigma,\\quad I_{M_{\\mathrm g}}(\\Gamma)=P_\\Gamma,\\quad\nE^{M_{\\mathrm g}}_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)=[t^\\flat_\\Gamma]:P_\\Gamma\\to\\tau.","display":true},{"tex":"E^M_{\\Delta,\\tau}(t[\\mathbf s])=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)\\circ A^M_\\Gamma(E^M_{\\Delta,\\gamma_1}(s_1),\\ldots,E^M_{\\Delta,\\gamma_n}(s_n)).","display":true},{"tex":"i^M_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\langle!_{T_M(\\sigma)},1_{T_M(\\sigma)}\\rangle,\\qquad\nF_M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq T_M(\\sigma),\\qquad\nF_M([v]:\\sigma\\to\\upsilon)\\coloneqq E^M_{(\\sigma),\\upsilon}(v)\\circ i^M_\\sigma,\\qquad\nF_M:\\mathsf S_\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal C.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:\\tau\n&\\Longleftrightarrow E^{M_{\\mathrm g}}_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)=E^{M_{\\mathrm g}}_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(u)\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\ \\bigl(\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longrightarrow E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(u)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A_\\Gamma(E(\\mathbf s))\\times1","display":false},{"tex":"[q_i]","display":false},{"tex":"q_i[a(\\mathbf t)]\\equiv t_i","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\Gamma\\times\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"q_i[\\pi_1x_1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_2x_1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\lambda_\\sigma v)^\\flat","display":false},{"tex":"M_{\\mathrm g}","display":false},{"tex":"[t^\\flat]=[u^\\flat]","display":false},{"tex":"(P_\\Gamma)\\vdash t^\\flat\\equiv u^\\flat:\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"e_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"t^\\flat[e_\\Gamma]\\equiv t","display":false},{"tex":"u^\\flat[e_\\Gamma]\\equiv u","display":false},{"tex":"F_M","display":false},{"tex":"p_2\\circ i^M_\\sigma=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho,\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"1\\times T_M(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"i^M_\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":5263,"backlinks":[{"id":"923cb52a5ddfc2cd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"类型唯一性按项树归纳，解释于是独立于类型推导的选择。代换引理为 $E^M_{\\Delta,\\tau}(t[\\mathbf s])=E^M_{\\Gamma,\\tau}(t)\\circ A^M_\\Gamma(E^M_{\\Delta,\\gamma_i}(s_i))$。变量、常量、积直接用配对泛性质；λ 分支用指数转置的自然性和弱化投影，应用分支用评价。该引理及每条 β/η 的可靠性在 [[16-thm-categorical-completeness]] 使用。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]、[[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]、[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]、[[16-thm-categorical-completeness]]、[[16-df-lambda-systems]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-signature]]、[[16-df-hagino-functor]]、[[16-thm-weak-initial-algebra]]、[[16-ex-church-weak-nno]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]、[[16-df-lambda-fibrations]]。"}],"outgoing":["923cb52a5ddfc2cd","899007f1346b21cf"]}